ed unchanged. F1: exposure expectations now assert the literal `directory_mesh_unsupported` / `terminal_backend_unavailable` tokens at the Negotiate entry (no committed test derives from the production constants) + 2 same-exit swap plants. F2: new `TestNegotiateUnknownGeneration` drives unknown generations x every frame through Negotiate (invalid_config/3, zero Decision) + Negotiate-site fallback plant. F3: docs name `LoadedConfiguration.SourceVersion` (not the normalized SchemaVersion) + `TestLocalMajorsTracksConfigVocabulary` pins the mapping against config.Version1/Version2/CurrentVersion/Version4 with a Decode-level normalization proof. F4: stated bound (non-rpc arrays validated by rpcwire decode, trusted here; direct callers must pass decode-produced hellos) pinned by `TestPeerOfferTrustsDecodedNonRPCArrays`; probe showed v2 lease 9.9.9 is admitted by decode too (valid range by design, not a hole). F5: frame rows 4.1.0/5.0.1/5.1.0 + 5.x-edge plant + unparseable-class bound stated. F6: TRACEABILITY 17.1 minor clause dropped. Harness now 31 narrowing killed / neutral passed / control SURVIVED (exit 0); 18/18 package tests green.\n","final_result":true}}}
